// A building the base game has never heard of.
//
// Same rule as a new good: an id the catalog has not seen is a new building if it says what
// it costs and how long it takes. It will employ people as soon as it stands.
//
// It will not produce anything - and so add nothing to GDP, which is the market value of what
// a country sells - until some recipe names it, which is the first thing to check
// when a mod's new works appear to do nothing. See common/production/new_chain.json.

{
